Subject: [PATCH v2 2/2] milter: expose DSN origin as an enum

Expose {postfix_dsn_origin} through normal macro-list negotiation. Return internal only for the bounce(8) cleanup flag and external for every other message. Document the source macro and add a focused cleanup Milter regression test.
---
